OL,3,CInvestigation underway after huge pile
OL,4,Cof waste illegally dumped
OL,6,FAn investigation is underway after a
OL,7,Fhuge pile of illegally dumped waste
OL,8,Fwas found in Leicestershire.
OL,10,FThe rubbish mound was found on a patch
OL,11,Fof land owned by Leicestershire County
OL,12,FCouncil off the A47 Leicester Road,
OL,13,Fbetween Hinckley and Earl Shilton.
OL,15,FThe authority said there is evidence
OL,16,Fof heavy goods equipment being used to
OL,17,Fcreate a soil embankment to shield the
OL,18,Farea from public view.
OL,20,FThe waste appears to include the
OL,21,Fcontents of household skips.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/4
