CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786110488
OL,3,CInvestigation underway after huge pile
OL,4,Cof waste illegally dumped
OL,6,FIt was first reported to the
OL,7,FEnvironment Agency, which is now
OL,8,Fworking with the council, and
OL,9,FLeicestershire Police's Rural Crime
OL,10,FTeam to gather evidence and find out
OL,11,Fwho is responsible.
OL,13,FA witness appeal is now underway, as
OL,14,Fpolice urge anyone who may have seen
OL,15,Fsuspicious activity in the area to
OL,16,Fcome forward. Officers have also asked
OL,17,Ffor anyone who may have dashcam, CCTV
OL,18,For doorbell footage from the area.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/4
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
