PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786110488
OL,3,CInvestigation underway after huge pile
OL,4,Cof waste illegally dumped
OL,6,FCouncil Leader Stuart Bray said: "This
OL,7,Fis a serious and deliberate act of
OL,8,Fwaste crime. Those responsible have
OL,9,Fnot only dumped a large amount of
OL,10,Fwaste; they have taken steps to hide
OL,11,Fwhat they were doing. That makes it
OL,12,Feven more important that anyone who
OL,13,Fsaw something unusual comes forward.
OL,15,F"We know residents will rightly be
OL,16,Fangry to see the countryside treated
OL,17,Fin this way. Our officers are working
OL,18,Fclosely with the police and
OL,19,FEnvironment Agency, and action has
OL,20,Falready been taken, including removing
OL,21,Ftwo vehicles from the site.
OL,26,@nD@bOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/4
