PN,34104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786110488
OL,3,CInvestigation underway after huge pile
OL,4,Cof waste illegally dumped
OL,6,F"Our priority now is to support the
OL,7,FEnvironment Agency's investigation,
OL,8,Fsecure the evidence and make sure
OL,9,Fthose responsible are held to account,
OL,10,Fincluding for the clean-up. If you saw
OL,11,Fanything that did not look right in
OL,12,Fthis area, please report it."
